cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its checkpoints, please cite the paper below.
title: "MAPA: Masked Autoencoder with Positional and Anatomical encodings"
abstract: >-
  MAPA applies an anatomical region embedding and a relative positional encoding to learn
  neural representations from unlabeled intracranial EEG recordings. The encoder is
  pretrained by masked autoencoding and frozen for downstream evaluation.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
